message: >-
  If you use this software or the Dynamic LeJEPA theoretical framework,
  please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Dynamic LeJEPA
authors:
  - family-names: Mostafa
    given-names: Mohsen
    email: mohsen.mostafa.ai@outlook.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dynamic-LeJEPA/Dynamic-LeJEPA"
abstract: >-
  Six theorems proving prediction and representation learning are decoupled in
  JEPAs; physics is provably benign in the decoder and destructive in the
  encoder. Validated on nuScenes and MimicGen with 60+ seeded runs, and a
  cautionary model-exploitation result for offline latent planning.
keywords: [JEPA, world-models, maximum-entropy, physics-informed, robotics]
license: MIT
